    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-5-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5(5) Establishment of Bureau and office of Statistician",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975#sec-5-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n\n(a) the Bureau is a listed entity; and\n\n(b) the Statistician is the accountable authority of the Bureau;\nand\n\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Bureau:\n\n(i) the Statistician;\n\n(ii) the staff referred to in subsection 16(1);\n\n(iii) persons engaged under subsection 16(2); and\n\n(d) the purposes of the Bureau include:\n\n(i) the functions of the Bureau referred to in section 6; and\n\n(ii) the functions of the Statistician referred to in\nsubsection (4) and section 4.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n\n(a) the Bureau is a listed entity; and\n\n(b) the Statistician is the accountable authority of the Bureau;\nand\n\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Bureau:\n\n(i) the Statistician;\n\n(ii) the staff referred to in subsection 16(1);\n\n(iii) persons engaged under subsection 16(2); and\n\n(d) the purposes of the Bureau include:\n\n(i) the functions of the Bureau referred to in section 6; and\n\n(ii) the functions of the Statistician referred to in\nsubsection (4) and section 4.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-5"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-5-ss-5-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1fce0049d8b50ae291ee09a3ac6559ec26494398d70f7dab01914c95f470e8d5",
      "skos:note": "Listed entity and accountable authority designation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975#sec-5-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(5) Establishment of Bureau and office of Statistician",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the\nPublic Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013):\n\n(a) the Bureau is a listed entity; and\n\n(b) the Statistician is the accountable authority of the Bureau;\nand\n\n(c) the following persons are officials of the Bureau:\n\n(i) the Statistician;\n\n(ii) the staff referred to in subsection 16(1);\n\n(iii) persons engaged under subsection 16(2); and\n\n(d) the purposes of the Bureau include:\n\n(i) the functions of the Bureau referred to in section 6; and\n\n(ii) the functions of the Statistician referred to in\nsubsection (4) and section 4."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-5-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
