      },
      "dc:source": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "The Minister may grant leave of absence to the Statistician upon\nsuch terms and conditions as to remuneration or otherwise as the\nMinister determines.",
