      },
      "dc:source": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Where the Governor-General suspends the Statistician from office,\nthe Minister shall cause a statement of the ground of the\nsuspension to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 7\nsitting days of that House after the suspension.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Where the Governor-General suspends the Statistician from office,\nthe Minister shall cause a statement of the ground of the\nsuspension to be laid before each House of the Parliament within 7\nsitting days of that House after the suspension.",
