    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16(4) Staff",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975#sec-16-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Statistician and the APS employees assisting the\nStatistician together constitute a Statutory Agency; and\n\n\nAustralian Bureau of Statistics and Australian Statistician  Part II\n\nSection 16A\n\nAustralian Bureau of Statistics Act 1975\nCompilation date: 3/5/19\nRegistered: 10/5/19\n\n(b) the Statistician is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Statistician and the APS employees assisting the\nStatistician together constitute a Statutory Agency; and\n\n\nAustralian Bureau of Statistics and Australian Statistician  Part II\n\nSection 16A\n\nAustralian Bureau of Statistics Act 1975\nCompilation date: 3/5/19\nRegistered: 10/5/19\n\n(b) the Statistician is the Head of that Statutory Agency.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "77624ef4b790e593fe2ad37d8e74b72da756d1cfaa1e87043bbe9d3f391b9941",
      "skos:note": "The Statistician and APS employees constitute a statutory agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975#sec-16-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16(4) Staff",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For the purposes of the Public Service Act 1999:\n\n(a) the Statistician and the APS employees assisting the\nStatistician together constitute a Statutory Agency; and\n\n\nAustralian Bureau of Statistics and Australian Statistician  Part II\n\nSection 16A\n\nAustralian Bureau of Statistics Act 1975\nCompilation date: 3/5/19\nRegistered: 10/5/19\n\n(b) the Statistician is the Head of that Statutory Agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16-ss-4-norm",
