    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16A Persons seconded to the Bureau",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975#sec-16a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Statistician may arrange with:\n\n(a) a governmental agency or governmental authority; or\n\n(b) an international organisation of an intergovernmental\ncharacter;\nfor the services of officers or employees of the agency, authority or\norganisation to be made available to assist in the carrying out of the\nfunctions of the Statistician.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies to an agency, authority or organisation,\nwhether in Australia or in a foreign country.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) has effect in addition to, and not in substitution for,\na provision of the Public Service Act 1999 that provides for the\nmaking of arrangements under which a person performs services in\nthe Bureau.\nNote:\nPersons whose services are made available in accordance with\narrangements made under the Public Service Act 1999 are covered by\nsubsection 16(1) of this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Statistician may arrange with:\n\n(a) a governmental agency or governmental authority; or\n\n(b) an international organisation of an intergovernmental\ncharacter;\nfor the services of officers or employees of the agency, authority or\norganisation to be made available to assist in the carrying out of the\nfunctions of the Statistician.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies to an agency, authority or organisation,\nwhether in Australia or in a foreign country.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) has effect in addition to, and not in substitution for,\na provision of the Public Service Act 1999 that provides for the\nmaking of arrangements under which a person performs services in\nthe Bureau.\nNote:\nPersons whose services are made available in accordance with\narrangements made under the Public Service Act 1999 are covered by\nsubsection 16(1) of this Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16a-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16a-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16a-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9316a1ed24726165fa0295caa431429cdb1a192cdf193dab4c102b98df2bf635"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975#sec-16a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "16A Persons seconded to the Bureau",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Statistician may arrange with:\n\n(a) a governmental agency or governmental authority; or\n\n(b) an international organisation of an intergovernmental\ncharacter;\nfor the services of officers or employees of the agency, authority or\norganisation to be made available to assist in the carrying out of the\nfunctions of the Statistician.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) applies to an agency, authority or organisation,\nwhether in Australia or in a foreign country.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) has effect in addition to, and not in substitution for,\na provision of the Public Service Act 1999 that provides for the\nmaking of arrangements under which a person performs services in\nthe Bureau.\nNote:\nPersons whose services are made available in accordance with\narrangements made under the Public Service Act 1999 are covered by\nsubsection 16(1) of this Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-bureau-of-statistics-act-1975-sec-16a-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "16A(1) Persons seconded to the Bureau",
